<title>HUNGARY: Hungarian reserves up to $10.4 bln in Sept.</title>
<headline>Hungarian reserves up to $10.4 bln in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's international reserves rose to a preliminary $10.4 billion at the end of September from $9.74 billion in August, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
